  "9": {
   "id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MjE5NDAyMjc4",
   "number": 9,
   "title": "Add `activeCount` and `pendingCount` properties to the limited function",
   "body": "In many cases you would want to know how many tasks are in the queue, for example to avoid adding too many tasks and cause memory overflow (i.e. DDOS).\r\nI know that this could be implemented with p-queue instead, but sometimes you only need this specific feature without the overhead of the whole p-queue package.\r\n\r\nI even added tests 😀 ",
   "createdAt": "2018-10-01T14:44:13Z",
   "updatedAt": "2018-12-25T14:12:19Z",
