 "issues": {
  "18": {
   "id": "MDU6SXNzdWU1NDQwNjgwMjQ=",
   "number": 18,
   "title": "Feature request: Ability to clear the queue",
   "body": "I'm not sure if this is a feature you'd want here, happy to open a PR if so.\r\n\r\nIn addition to being able to read the values for `activeCount` and `pendingCount`, I would like also to be  able to clear the queue.\r\n\r\nThe driving use case is that I would like to only run with the latest arguments if there are pending calls.  E.g. I have a function that performs an expensive API based validation, and I only care about the current state of things, not the intermediary state.\r\n\r\nIs this a feature that you believe should live here?  Thanks in advance.",
   "createdAt": "2019-12-31T02:25:44Z",
   "updatedAt": "2020-04-05T15:37:34Z",
   "state": "CLOSED",
   "stateReason": "COMPLETED",
